    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div data-ft-canon-sephirotic=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div><p><em>\"There is no angle that is not a front, to a thing with no back.\"</em></p><p><strong>The Wheel Never Stops (1/Soma Break).</strong> When you move at least 2 squares on your turn, as a bonus action take either one weapon attack OR the Dash. Additional uses per Soma Break cost 1 Surge each (player-managed via Surge controls).</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"sephOphanicWheel\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\"><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #d4b8e8; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-size: 0.78rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>The Wheel Never Stops</strong></span> <span style=\"opacity: 0.92; line-height: 1.4; font-size: 0.86rem\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Soma Break (+1 Surge per extra use)  ·  <strong>Action:</strong> Bonus action (after moving 2 squares)  ·  <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</span> <span style=\"opacity: 0.85; margin-top: 0.3rem; font-size: 0.82rem\">After moving ≥ 2 squares, bonus action: one weapon attack OR Dash. Each additional use this Soma Break costs 1 Surge — spend manually.</span></p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
